<title>SOUTH AFRICA: AMIC APPOINTS REDSHAW TO BOARD.</title>
<headline>AMIC APPOINTS REDSHAW TO BOARD.</headline>
<dateline>JOHANNESBURG 1997-07-01</dateline>
<text>
<p>South Africa's Anglo American Industrial Corp Ltd (Amic) on Tuesday said it had appointed David Redshaw of Fintech Ltd as alternate director to Allied Electronics Corp Ltd chairman William Venter, on the Amic board of directors.</p>
<p>-- Johannesburg newsroom 27 11 482 1003</p>
</text>
